silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_27_governance_shacl_deep_dive_sections_03_unified_constraint_theorem_concrete_anchor_1#governance_gateforms silm:hasLongDescription "The Governance_GateForms is concrete governance gate forms: vet-record admission, audit-trail certification, internal-review gates. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Governance_GateForms', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
